OL,3,GNEWSAGrandma calls for end of early
OL,4,Ajail release scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe grandmother of a man killed by a
OL,7,Fprisoner who was released under the
OL,8,Fgovernment's early release programme
OL,9,Fhours earlier has said the scheme
OL,10,Fshould be stopped.
OL,12,FJoy Dove's grandson Lewis Bell, 26, was
OL,13,Fstabbed to death in a dispute over a
OL,14,Fdrugs den in September 2024 in
OL,15,FStockton-on-Tees.
OL,17,FLiam Matthews, who hit Bell with a
OL,18,Fchisel, had been released from HMP
OL,19,FHolme House on 18 September, eight days
OL,20,Fafter the government's early release
OL,21,Fscheme came into force to help ease
OL,22,Fpressure on crowded prisons.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
