OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAGrandma calls for end of early
OL,4,Ajail release scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FDove, from Stockton, said: "It's awful
OL,7,Fto think he got released on that early
OL,8,Fscheme." The Ministry of Justice (MoJ)
OL,9,Fsaid it was "pulling every lever to fix
OL,10,Fthe broken justice system".
